From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Scrumpper <190908034+Scrumpper@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 22:38:15 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 32/59] Revert "phy: rockchip: samsung-hdptx: accept
 rockchip,rk3588-hdptx-phy-hdmi"

This reverts commit e4ac3cdff (series 0013). The compatible served the
8.0 overlay DTB on 6.1, whose HDMI PHY nodes use it. The 6.12 board DTS
uses the vendor compatibles and no node in any 6.12 DTB names
rockchip,rk3588-hdptx-phy-hdmi, so the match entry is dead code on this
tree. 6.12 t6.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01P6itje71iKPFBX7YKkfvRo
---
 drivers/phy/rockchip/phy-rockchip-samsung-hdptx.c | 5 -----
 1 file changed, 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/phy/rockchip/phy-rockchip-samsung-hdptx.c b/drivers/phy/rockchip/phy-rockchip-samsung-hdptx.c
index b4dd03491..c3bd876ec 100644
--- a/drivers/phy/rockchip/phy-rockchip-samsung-hdptx.c
+++ b/drivers/phy/rockchip/phy-rockchip-samsung-hdptx.c
@@ -3124,11 +3124,6 @@ static const struct of_device_id rk_hdptx_phy_of_match[] = {
 		.compatible = "rockchip,rk3588-hdptx-phy",
 		.data = &rk3588_hdptx_phy_cfgs
 	},
-	{
-		/* H96: pre-rkr7 vendor DTBs bind HDMI through a separate hdmiphy node */
-		.compatible = "rockchip,rk3588-hdptx-phy-hdmi",
-		.data = &rk3588_hdptx_phy_cfgs
-	},
 	{}
 };
 MODULE_DEVICE_TABLE(of, rk_hdptx_phy_of_match);
